{"ref":"BDB, סְנַפִּיר","hw":"סְנַפִּיר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סְנַפִּיר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>fin (</strong>NH id.; quadrilit. according to Sta<sup>§ 243</sup>; Fl Levy<sup>NHWB iii. 725 a</sup> cp. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">סִמְפּוֹרִין</span> <em>points, nails</em>, and der. this from <span dir=\"rtl\">סַמֵּר</span> vb. <em>nail</em>, with infixed פ (Levy<sup>ChWBii. 570 b</sup>)<strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.9\">Lv 11:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.12\">12</a> = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.9\">Dt 14:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.10\">10</a>.","next":"BDB, סָ֑ס","prev":"BDB, סַנְסִנִּים"}